      "content": "i dont want to \"keep breathing\" through it. that's the thing. there's no \"storm\" passing. the landscape has just changed. the version of me that mattered is actually dead. i'm just a ghost haunting my own life. how do you even begin to fix a reputation that's been systematically dismantled? there's nothing left to rebuild.",
